{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>I am Pharaoh, and without you, etc.</b> Meaning — the kingship is mine, for 'Pharaoh' denotes a royal title. <b>And without you no man shall lift, etc.</b> — meaning, his authority will follow after him such that without him, no one shall, etc. And therefore he said with the additional ו״ו — for it was fitting to preface the mention of his authority by saying 'I am Pharaoh,' as I have explained."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:47:44.072779079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}